    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d480">

                <pb facs="0625" n="523" xml:id="pg523"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/2444: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Tenney</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-09-30T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 30,
                                1919, 3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Substance of your September 29, 5 p.m.,<anchor n="18" xml:id="d480-f1"/> has been
                    repeated to London and Paris for information and for such discreet use as
                    Ambassadors may deem judicious in furtherance of effort to expedite a favorable
                    decision by the British and French Governments.</p>
                <p>What has been or is being done with reference to the currency loan option held by
                    old consortium which expires October 11?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
